# James O'Brien Open Issues Update

## Goal
For every open issue assigned to James O'Brien:
- If it has a milestone, set health status to `on track`.
- If it has no milestone, assign it to the `Backlog` milestone and add the `needs-discussion` label.

## Todo
- [ ] Find all open issues assigned to James O'Brien
- [ ] For each issue with a milestone, set health status to on track
- [ ] For each issue without a milestone, assign Backlog milestone
- [ ] For each issue without a milestone, add needs-discussion label
- [ ] Verify updates are complete




